From 70a3e4b3307f2af6d2ba641859f5299cf05b8e9f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seann <seann@local>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:38:01 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Add [button_gesture]: hold a button and turn the wheel to run
 commands

A plain tap with no wheel movement is replayed as a normal click on
release, so the button keeps its usual job. Used to flip windows with
Omelette by holding the thumb's back button.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
